  ('ec35876b-94bf-4a92-877c-44ec5b1d4b5d', '4467498651', 'SAP FI/CO Consultant- English speaking role', 'We are currently looking for an experienced SAP FI/CO Consultant to join an international organisation and support the further development of its SAP Finance landscape.

