  ('7462a697-9590-44ac-8032-183fc4411ab4', '4465546785', 'SAP SD Consultant', 'About Atos Group

Atos Group is a global leader in digital transformation with c. 56,000 employees and annual revenue of c. €7.2 billion (at the go-forward perimeter), operating in 54 countries under two brands - Atos for services and Eviden for products and systems. European number one in cybersecurity and a leader in cloud, Atos Group is committed to a secure and decarbonized future and provides tailored AI-powered, end-to-end solutions for all industries. Atos Group is the brand under which Atos SE (Societas Europaea) operates. Atos SE listed on Euronext Paris.

The purpose of Atos Group is to help design the future of the information space. Its expertise and services support the development of knowledge, education and research in a multicultural approach and contribute to the development of scientific and technological excellence. Across the world, the Group enables its customers and employees, and members of societies at large to live, work and develop sustainably, in a safe and secure information space.

SAP SD Consultant

Responsibilities

Knowledge of business processes within a designated functional area (Sales and Distribution).
Capability to work independently and effectively as part of project team on Implementation, Roll-out or Application maintenance projects.
Communicate with customers to understand and collect relevant requirements.
Participate in business workshops and conduct Fit-to-Standard Analysis.
Configure and customize SAP Logistics, Sales, and Supply Chain solutions in alignment with customer requirements.
Writing blueprint documents and specifications for developers.
Create various project documentation, including training materials for application users.
Customers support in daily work in productive system.
Foster productive working relationships with related business partners with a focus on continuously identifying areas for improvement
Ability to cooperate across multiple teams to troubleshoot and resolve issues including ability to research OSS notes.
Skills in enhancement techniques, including user exits, enhancement points, and Badis is not obligatory, but it''ll be considered an advantage.
Understanding of SAP Fiori launchpad is an advantage.


Job requirements

Proven track record of at least 3 years of solid experience in Sales and Distribution area.
English language proficiency at B2 level (no certificate needed, confident communication with stakeholders, ability to convey ideas clearly)
Proficiency in Serbian.
Good knowledge of MS Office.
High analytical skills. 
Strong organizational skills, with attention to detail and the ability to multitask.


What We Offer

Hybrid work model — flexibility to combine office (Belgrade and Novi Sad).
Private health insurance.
Private pension.
FitPass card for recreation and sports.
Opportunity to gain experience across different platforms.
Opportunity to work with a dedicated team of people.


Here at Atos, diversity and inclusion are embedded in our DNA. Read more about our commitment to a fair work environment for all.

Atos is a recognized leader in its industry across Environment, Social and Governance (ESG) criteria. Find out more on our CSR commitment.

Choose your future. Choose Atos. 
