  ('0ce0e595-c080-4e50-b684-de9f62e3a1df', '4442576876', 'SAP Integration Senior Consultant', 'Choosing Capgemini means choosing a company where you will be empowered to shape your career in the way you’d like, where you’ll be supported and inspired by a collaborative community of colleagues around the world, and where you’ll be able to reimagine what’s possible. Join us and help the world’s leading organizations unlock the value of technology and build a more sustainable, more inclusive world.

