Come and work at the heart of change

We are looking for a SAP Treasury Consultant with experience in SAP IHB In house bank + SAP APM Advance payment management. A talented, fun, collaborative person willing to bring added knowledge to our highly specialized team. If you thrive working in a fast-paced environment; working with prestigious clients, moving frequently from project to project to solve significant business challenges… then, we’d like to meet you!

The work:

As a dedicated SAP Treasury professional, you have a proven track record in developing and/or maintaining robust Treasury operating models that cover both the organizational as well as the operational framework of a best in class Treasury organization. You are contributing to our teams’ success with profound knowledge in system integration combined with deep business process and technical skills to analyse, design, build and implement SAP Treasury in our European and global clients.

The areas of expertise that will be considered for these positions are:


SAP IHB - In House Bank
SAP APM Advance Payment Management.
SAP Cash & Liquidity Management 
SAP Cash Management on S/4HANA 
SAP BCM – Bank Communication Management 
SAP TRM – Treasury and Risk Management 
SAP IHC – In house Cash 
SAP FSCM (Credit Management) 
SAP Dispute and Collection Management 
