  ('402cac32-bf41-429b-8a89-5c87f0e567f2', '4328049744', 'SAP SuccessFactors Consultant', 'Accenture Technology – SAP

At Accenture Portugal, we are trailblazers in innovation, leading the charge in digital transformation and redefining possibilities within the SAP ecosystem. As a global powerhouse in professional services, we seamlessly blend deep industry expertise with cutting‑edge technology to empower our clients to achieve extraordinary business results. Our SAP teams are passionate about unlocking the full potential of SAP solutions, streamlining processes, boosting performance, and driving sustainable growth across industries.

