  ('aeb88ded-b6df-491f-8e81-ad5a01935b42', '4403984710', 'SAP IBP Planning Consultant', 'Join Accenture and help transform leading organizations and communities around the world. The sheer scale of our capabilities and client engagements and the way we collaborate, operate and deliver value provides an unparalleled opportunity to grow and advance. Choose Accenture and make delivering innovative work part of your extraordinary career.

