As an IBP Consultant you may Delivery advisory services to the SCM organizations of our clients on how specially SAP technologies enable a modern and digital SCM function. Deconstruct key business problems to identify value areas and structure and implement complex technology solutions for clients basically around SAP solutions but also on other platforms. Create innovative and differentiated SAP SCM offerings, staying relevant and in sync with market changes, innovations and best practises.

Key Responsibilities:


Overseeing the end to end implementation of Planning solution mainly in SAP IBP
Define and configure business process and challenges in the following areas : S&OP, Demand Planning and Supply Planning
Advising organizations on how to implement best practices and support on business process transformation based on value driven principals.
Participate on integration model from planning system with execution system,
Supporting our customers and Accenture delivery teams in SAP IBP engagement


What can we offer you?


To join a company that’s consolidated and shows a great international growth, in which the most important element are the people that belong to it.
To complete your profile with training in other areas of knowledge, such as work methodology, communication abilities, teamwork…
The undertaking of your professional career, guaranteeing personal growth through your contributions to the projects you participate in.
To be part of young and dynamic teams, where your will be able to share knowledge and experiences with other professionals like you. 


Basic Qualifications


Minimum 3 years’ experience in consulting.
Minimum 3 years’ experience in Supply Chain Planning: S&OP, Demand planning and Supply Planning
At least 1-year experience on SAP IBP Implementations.
Knowledge of other planning system like: Kinaxis, JDA, SAP APO, Infor, E2open is a plus.
Fluent in English
Ability to conduct workshops, gather requirements, perform fit-gap analysis, design to-be solution, design configuration rationale and create functional designs.
Ability to work in multicultural / multiskilled environment


