  ('22dd4228-0069-4757-9163-8545efc4cae7', '4467074248', 'SAP BTP Cloud Integration Architect', 'Senior Cloud Integration Architect - SAP BTP

Do you have experience in interfacing end-to-end business processes in complex enterprise systems, in both cloud and on-premise and are you looking to take your career to the next level in 2025?

This is a rare opportunity to join Germany''s highest-rated workplace, tackling the largest and most exciting projects on the planet, working with the latest innovative technology.

On Offer:

Culture - Join “the best employer in Germany” and a Diamond award winner in the Energy Sector. 
Compensation - Market Leading Salary, Company Car, range of additional benefits, and family support. 
Flexible Working with Very Low Travel requirements, with over 14 office locations in Germany and 26 across Europe an impressive Company Car Package. 
Ability to work anywhere in Europe Colleagues can work up to 165 days per year from anywhere in the EU. 
Climb the ladder - Training combined with project delivery enables clear routes to promotion at every level, which is reviewed annually. 
Training - Benefit from the training hub consisting of 360+ courses with which you can develop your specialist knowledge (e.g. relevant certificates, industry/tech training) and your soft skills (presentation and communication techniques, mindfulness & resilience etc). 


Your responsibilities will include:

Being a pioneer of digital transformation and modernization of business processes in companies. 
Advising customers on how they can efficiently integrate and orchestrate their business processes and systems. 
Take them to the next evolutionary step and integrate complex SAP and non-SAP systems in native and hybrid cloud landscapes. 
Conceptualize and design complex integration architectures and concepts using the latest SAP technologies. 
Translate the technical requirements of our customers into technical integration solutions. 
You will successfully implement your integration concepts based on SAP integration technologies on the SAP Business Technology Platform. 
You accompany customers from the decision-making process for the right integration technology and platform to the successful go-live of the project. 
With your expertise, you will quickly take over project responsibility. 
You develop across disciplines and bring in your own ideas and interests. 


Experience you bring with you:

Ability to present to clients in both German and English 
In-depth knowledge of integration with SAP technologies, Business Technology Platform (BTP) or SAP Process Integration / SAP Process Orchestration. 
You are no stranger to web services such as SOAP / REST as well as data exchange formats such as JSON and XML. 
You are very familiar with proprietary SAP interface technologies such as ALE, BAPI, RFC and IDOC. 
You have experience in one or more SAP solutions and their integration (SAP S/4HANA, SAP SuccessFactors, SAP Ariba ...). 
You have professional experience in the conception and implementation of integration scenarios for SAP and non-SAP solutions. 
A cross-disciplinary and cross-technological way of thinking and strong communication skills tailored to the target group. 
Your attitude is characterized by a customer-centred way of working, a learning self-image and enjoyment of working in a team.
