  ('d820323c-bf17-456f-8577-683737832072', 'd7ac674c-3e43-4c9d-be7e-050cfc438d8e', 'SAP PP Techno-functional Consultant- English speaking role', 'Are you interested in joining an international manufacturing company? Do you have experience with ABAP programming? Do you have a good knowledge of SAP PP processes and customization? Would you like to participate in international projects?
Are you fluent in English?

Then look no further!

My client is looking for an SAP PP Consultant/ with ABAP programming skills to join their successful team in Vienna on a permanent basis.

The right candidate MUST:

Be fluent in English
Has at least 3+ years SAP ABAP and SAP PP experience
Good process knowledge of SAP PP
Willing to deepen your SAP PP functional skills and or ABAP programming skills
Must be eligible to work in Austria
Happy to be in the office 3 times a week
Happy to live in Austria

Your Role
