  ('4c409662-22fd-4cb6-8961-c92f182ed42b', '5386641c-67d3-4ad5-ad85-612833fbfa96', 'SAP IS-U Billing & FI-CA Consultant', 'Company Description

Sopra Steria is Europe’s leading digital solutions provider, employing over 56,000 employees in 30 countries. We provide tailored, end-to-end corporate technology and software solutions. We leverage our digital tools and market expertise to help our clients make bold choices and deliver results in a competitive world. Our commitment to innovation, collaboration and value in business development is why we’re the preferred technology partner of Europe’s most successful companies.

The world is how we shape it, so let’s shape it together.

Job Description

We are seeking an experienced SAP IS-U Billing and FI‑CA Consultant to support and enhance our utilities business processes. The ideal candidate has a strong functional background in SAP for Utilities, with deep expertise in Billing & Invoicing, and Contract Accounting (FI‑CA). This role involves solution design, configuration, testing, incident resolution, and support during project implementations or ongoing operations..

Your responsibilities include:

Functional Design & Configuration
Analyze business requirements and translate them into functional specifications for SAP IS-U Billing and FI‑CA.
Configure SAP IS-U components:
Billing & Invoicing (IS-U/BI)
Rate Structure, RTP, Schema Development
Scheduling & Billing Execution
Configure FI‑CA processes:
Business Partner, Contract Accounts
Payment processing (inbound/outbound)
Dunning & Collections
Interest calculation
Clearing & Reconciliation
Ensure integration across IS-U modules (DM, EDM, AMI,..) and with SAP FI/CO.
