Project Delivery

Participate in SAP rollout, upgrade, or migration projects. Collaborate with cross-functional teams (Basis, Development, Middleware, Finance). Assist in designing new business solutions and optimizing existing processes. Support go-live and hypercare activities.

Stakeholder Management

Act as a trusted advisor for business stakeholders in Billing and FI‑CA topics. Provide functional expertise during workshops, requirement gathering sessions, and training.

Qualifications

We’re seeking passionate colleagues who are eager to push the boundaries of digital transformation and ERP-driven business change. At Sopra Steria, you’ll have the opportunity to grow your skills in a constructive, collaborative team environment, working on large-scale SAP projects that deliver real value for our clients. If you thrive on challenge and meet (most of) the qualifications below, we look forward to your application!

