  ('70d82345-f70b-402c-8d36-725e51f8cc40', '00de8658-6c73-4427-a7f0-6ac396cb7ef5', 'SAP EWM/MFS Consultant', 'Join the #1 rated workplace in Germany and make a significant impact on some of the most exciting projects in the industry. Don’t miss this rare chance to join the most sought-after team in SAP consulting!

On Offer:
Structured career progression & mentoring to Director and Partner, including paid certifications and leadership training.
Chance to work with one of the most experienced SAP SCM teams in Germany.
Salaries ranging from €70,000 - €110,000.
Opportunity to work with the latest SAP EWM technologies and MFS developments.
Highest paid bonus in the SAP consulting industry.
Multiple winner of the SAP Pinnacle Award.
30 days paid vacation & public holidays.
Flexibility with travel - home office and remote working options.

Your Role:
Supporting and advising customers on the SAP solutions used in the various project phases.
Participating in the planning, design, and implementation of complex transformation projects in the various project phases.
Designing and implementing the connection of conveyor technology to SAP EWM using MFS.
Implementing complex solution concepts through customization.
Participating in the creation of interface definitions for conveyor systems together with our customers.

Your Skills:
You must be fluent in English!
Minimum 1+ years of hands-on experience with SAP EWM and MFS.
Very good understanding of SAP architectures and technology platforms.
Comfortable performing customizing tasks in EWM & MFS.
S/4 HANA project experience is a must.
Must be living or have a desire to relocate to Germany.
