  ('f61d15e9-2efe-423d-ae2b-50bbda8e3d7a', '089fb668-b9f9-44c3-b431-2baa88c9629d', 'SAP FI Consultant', '***SAP FI Consultant- 6 Month contract role - Hybrid (Yvelines, Paris)***


On behalf of one of our partners, RED now has a new contract opportunity for an SAP FICO Consultant to join one of our key partners for an S4/HANA rollout. Template has been completed, project is currently in R3 roadmap. The initial contract will be for 6 months with likely extension.


