You will be responsible for delivering SAP FI solutions within an S/4HANA rollout programme, focusing on FI customisation, configuration, testing, system integration, deployment support, and post-go-live activities, with strong experience in S/4HANA rollouts. 


Desired skills:
5+ years hands-on experience with SAP FI
S4/HANA experience
Strong experience with S4/HANA rollouts
Fluent in French and English
Strong Stakeholder management experience
Experience with Go-live/hypercare support
Available 4 days on site per week

If interested please send your up to date CV to jisaksen@redglobal.com. We also accept referrals.
