Ability to present to clients in both German and English 
In-depth knowledge of integration with SAP technologies, Business Technology Platform (BTP) or SAP Process Integration / SAP Process Orchestration. 
You are no stranger to web services such as SOAP / REST as well as data exchange formats such as JSON and XML. 
You are very familiar with proprietary SAP interface technologies such as ALE, BAPI, RFC and IDOC. 
You have experience in one or more SAP solutions and their integration (SAP S/4HANA, SAP SuccessFactors, SAP Ariba ...). 
You have professional experience in the conception and implementation of integration scenarios for SAP and non-SAP solutions. 
A cross-disciplinary and cross-technological way of thinking and strong communication skills tailored to the target group. 
Your attitude is characterized by a customer-centred way of working, a learning self-image and enjoyment of working in a team.
