Location:

Weinheim, BW, DE, 69469

Functional Area: Hybrid

Syntax is a leading Managed Cloud Provider for Mission Critical Enterprise Applications and has been providing comprehensive technology solutions to businesses of all sizes since 1972. Syntax has undisputed strength to implement and manage ERP deployments (Oracle, SAP) in a secure and resilient private, public or hybrid cloud. With strong technical and functional consulting services, and world-class monitoring and automation, Syntax serves some of North America’s largest corporations across a diverse range of industries. Syntax has offices worldwide, and partners with Oracle, SAP, AWS, Microsoft, IBM and other global technology leaders.

Remote, hybrid, or at our office in Weinheim 

At Syntax, we support companies worldwide on their journey toward a digital future. As a Technical Solution Architect for SAP Migration, you will play a key role in transformation projects—from planning to the successful implementation of complex data migrations in SAP landscapes. You combine technical expertise with strategic insight to ensure that data is transferred to new systems securely, efficiently, and with the highest quality.

Your Responsibilities

Technical design, planning, and management of SAP data migration projects as part of S/4HANA transformations, system conversions, and system consolidations
Development of holistic migration strategies, architectures, and concepts based on existing system and data landscapes
Analysis and evaluation of existing data structures, as well as definition of data cleansing and transformation approaches
Design and implementation of scalable and automated migration processes and data validations
Use and further development of SAP migration tools such as SAP Migration Cockpit, SAP Data Services, LTMC/LTMOM, BAPIs, IDocs, or other ETL technologies
Close collaboration with solution architects, business units, developers, and project managers to ensure seamless integration of the migration into the overall project
Technical support for test cycles, cutover planning, and go-live activities
Defining standards, best practices, and governance structures for data migrations, as well as handling documentation and knowledge transfer

Your Profile

Several years of experience in SAP data migration, ideally in the context of S/4HANA transformations or complex SAP programs
Experience in the technical architecture and design of data migration scenarios
In-depth understanding of SAP data models and experience with at least one SAP module (e.g., MM, SD, PP, QM, EWM, or comparable)
Practical experience with migration technologies such as SAP Migration Cockpit, SAP Data Services, LSMW, BAPIs, and IDocs, as well as a strong technical understanding of ABAP
Very good understanding of data quality, data governance, and data harmonization
Analytical, structured, and solution-oriented approach to work
Very good German and English language skills
Willingness to participate in international projects

Why Syntax?

Become a part of our success story and work in a company with exciting innovation projects that are causing a stir across the industry. We recently launched one of the world''s most advanced manufacturing facilities based on SAP S/4HANA Cloud and SAP Digital Manufacturing Cloud for Execution - for Smart Press Shop, a pioneering joint venture between Porsche and forming specialist Schuler.

Competitive, above-average compensation
